{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《ViuTV 2027節目巡禮》今日（21/10）在麥花臣舉行，率先登場介紹係改編同名劇集《金秘書為何那樣》，由盧瀚霆（Anson Lo）、蘇雅琳(Ivy So）主演，而Anson Lo就即場表演兩個充滿自戀及霸道嘅招牌動作，飾演員工嘅駱振偉及Sica都畀足反應。</p><figure><img alt=\"為節目巡禮打頭陣有劇集《金秘書為何那樣》，由盧瀚霆（Anson Lo）、蘇雅琳(Ivy So）主演（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189632120377708544347912.jpeg/lALNRzz8vPyl4Y8rCWCcEnV6RrT0oEA-z7C9jfWwvY0\"/><figcaption>為節目巡禮打頭陣有劇集《金秘書為何那樣》，由盧瀚霆（Anson Lo）、蘇雅琳(Ivy So）主演（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"為節目巡禮打頭陣有劇集《金秘書為何那樣》，由盧瀚霆（Anson Lo）、蘇雅琳(Ivy So）主演（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189632117504479232294013.jpeg/GZG9JVqPky0kwDLF5OQsR8ccfXRP0TmBM14o7wleKO8\"/><figcaption>為節目巡禮打頭陣有劇集《金秘書為何那樣》，由盧瀚霆（Anson Lo）、蘇雅琳(Ivy So）主演（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><p>問到Ivy So平時見到Anson Lisa見到呢動作會有咩反應?「如果係Ivy So就會咁（畀like），但如果係金秘書，就會咁（不屑眼神）。」如果現實中老闆成日咁自戀，Ivy So又點處理？「會畀Like，因為有糧出。」</p><figure><img alt=\"Anson Lo即場示範兩大自戀動作。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189632395276587008072964.jpeg/frTxXZyie6kcD7J6kj5LdTmoG8hjEulKp-ZFlJ3mRZQ\"/><figcaption>Anson Lo即場示範兩大自戀動作。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Anson Lo即場示範兩大自戀動作。（葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189632392109756416142530.jpeg/VcNyiHpEJClkVRQ4gfZpjv7vLolRg7m_SXb_L3N2_y8\"/><figcaption>Anson Lo即場示範兩大自戀動作。（葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"令人期待！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189632649179172864790328.jpeg/bMaDYWhnVaSn2HlSGIC7SQbkq--tdqNvE2npAhNp6QI\"/><figcaption>令人期待！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"令人期待！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189632646188503040469781.jpeg/a26p-_IV1_KL3cbXDag-wpuy3QfQ1ykOqMRLv6jES78\"/><figcaption>令人期待！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"令人期待！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189632643235581952384129.jpeg/zL5gRUVOvj8tsqDfoB5suJEJXvR7e_lb8KtlifCrZYk\"/><figcaption>令人期待！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"令人期待！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189632640089722880791825.jpeg/uitspemR7pvgA_5OnEFg--dFqf_8wvK46q6REequkRE\"/><figcaption>令人期待！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"令人期待！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189632637082275840921580.jpeg/9ZVY9u8NtlgkuKwAoAZ4rx0MYYL0wsQXvImEKryJhCo\"/><figcaption>令人期待！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:00:09.487050+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":473,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:45:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:39.883378+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:57:38.889634+00:00","content_hash":"734ceaee8283710e5ddf0930af7439893bfc818fb0417ef4cb0d13b983cd3ee0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}